\":{\"body\":\"Wenn dein Workspace berechtigt ist, kann ein Workspace-Inhaber unter „Vorteile“ Werbeguthaben anfordern. Wähle „Weiter“, um einen separaten Business-Workspace einzurichten.\",\"headline\":\"ChatGPT Business\"},\"workspace_owner\":{\"headline\":\"Prüfe die Vorteile deines Workspaces\",\"body\":\"Öffne „Vorteile“, um zu prüfen, ob dein Workspace für Werbeguthaben berechtigt ist.\"}},\"en\":{\"business_claim\":{\"headline\":\"Explore workspace ad credits\",\"body\":\"Sign in to the account you use for your Business workspace.\"},\"default\":{\"headline\":\"Explore ChatGPT Business\",\"body\":\"Learn about ad credits for eligible workspaces.\"},\"workspace_owner\":{\"body\":\"Open Benefits to see whether your workspace is eligible for ad credits.\",\"headline\":\"Check your workspace benefits\"},\"workspace_admin\":{\"headline\":\"Help your team find ad credits\",\"body\":\"Ask a workspace owner to check Benefits for the ad credit offer.\"},\"workspace\":{\"headline\":\"Explore workspace ad credits\",\"body\":\"A workspace owner can check Benefits for available offers.\"},\"personal_upsell\":{\"headline\":\"Bring your team to Business\",\"body\":\"Explore ChatGPT Business and the ad credit offer for eligible workspaces.\"},\"personal\":{\"body\":\"Explore the offer for your team. Already use Business? Switch to your workspace.\",\"headline\":\"Bring your team to Business\"},\"workspace_member\":{\"headline\":\"ChatGPT Business\",\"body\":\"If your workspace is eligible, an owner can claim ad credits in Benefits. To set up a separate Business workspace, select Continue.\"}},\"fr\":{\"workspace_owner\":{\"body\":\"Ouvrez la rubrique « Avantages » pour voir si votre espace de travail est éligible aux crédits publicitaires.\",\"headline\":\"Consultez les avantages de votre espace de travail\"},\"workspace_member\":{\"body\":\"Si votre espace de travail est éligible, un propriétaire peut demander des crédits publicitaires dans la rubrique « Avantages ». Pour c