ect Prod Agent\",\"key\":\"budget_direct_prod_agent\"},{\"label\":\"Lowes Prod Agent\",\"key\":\"lowes_prod_agent\"},{\"key\":\"image_card_v2_personalized_ads_mvp_2_composer_pinned\",\"label\":\"Personalized: Composer Pinned (Server)\"},{\"key\":\"pending_carousel_square\",\"label\":\"Pending: Carousel 1:1 — 4 images\"},{\"label\":\"Pending: Slideshow 16:9 — 4 images\",\"key\":\"pending_slideshow_landscape\"},{\"label\":\"Pending: Slideshow 16:9 — 4 images (collapse after image generation, iOS)\",\"key\":\"pending_slideshow_landscape_collapse_on_image_completion\"},{\"label\":\"Travel Feed: Variant A — Rating on image\",\"key\":\"travel_feed_carousel\"},{\"key\":\"travel_feed_variant_b\",\"label\":\"Travel Feed: Variant B — Title and price\"},{\"label\":\"Travel Feed: Variant C — Rating below title\",\"key\":\"travel_feed_variant_c\"},{\"label\":\"Travel Feed: Single hotel\",\"key\":\"travel_feed_single\"},{\"label\":\"Travel Feed: Ten-point rating\",\"key\":\"travel_feed_ten_point\"},{\"key\":\"travel_feed_sparse_metadata\",\"label\":\"Travel Feed: Sparse metadata\"},{\"label\":\"Pending: Image Card V2 — Single\",\"key\":\"pending_image_card_v2_single\"},{\"label\":\"Pending: Image Card V2 — Single (collapse after image generation, iOS)\",\"key\":\"pending_image_card_v2_single_collapse_on_image_completion\"},{\"label\":\"Pending: Product Card V2 — Single\",\"key\":\"pending_product_card_v2_single\"},{\"label\":\"Pending: Compact Product Carousel — No price\",\"key\":\"pending_product_carousel\"},{\"key\":\"pending_slideshow_landscape_auto_scroll\",\"label\":\"Pending: Slideshow 16:9 — 4 images (Auto-scroll)\"},{\"key\":\"conversation_bottom_slideshow_square_single\",\"label\":\"Conversation Bottom: Slideshow 1:1 — 1 image\"},{\"key\":\"previous_ad_native_image_preamble\",\"label\":\"ImageCardV2: Native — Preamble\"},{\"label\":\"ImageCardV2: Native — Keep visible on next send\",\"key\":\"previous_ad_native_image_keep_visible\"},{\"key\":\"geico_test_agent\",\"label\":\"GEICO Test Agent\"},{\"key\":\"image_card_v2_single_one_line\",\"label\":\"ImageCardV2: Single — One-line subtitle\"}]},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"1122994996\":{\"name\":\"1122994996\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"version\":31,\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"schemaVersion\":1,\"templates\":[{\"source\":{\"format\":\"presentation-protobuf\",\"sha256\":\"752ddf9ebb318c4a11e37373dbf053e6450336b9ed45a62eacf4d042f51c6eae\",\"byteLength\":410320,\"url\":\"https://persistent.oaistatic.com/space-presentation-templates/product-strategy/c98a598ca5cbf03c29c276219182769ab676c32033bde9db71dd2c205624d721/presentation.pb\"},\"title\":\"Product Strategy\",\"publisher\":\"openai\",\"id\":\"product-strategy\",\"revision\":\"c98a598ca5cbf03c29c276219182769ab676c32033bde9db71dd2c205624d721\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://persistent.oaistatic.com/space-presentation-templates/product-strategy/c98a598ca5cbf03c29c276219182769ab676c32033bde9db71dd2c205624d721/cover.png\"},{\"title\":\"Weekly Business Review\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://persistent.oaistatic.com/space-presentation-templates/weekly-business-review/28b9e7ae1f36383f5b9079f13744a190972ddb1c6266663789584d53c37dc750/cover.png\",\"publisher\":\"openai\",\"revision\":\"28b9e7ae1f36383f5b9079f13744a190972ddb1c6266663789584d53c37dc750\",\"source\":{\"sha256\":\"205ca471d698cf2b4037cd9bedadabb7e8eabc87c130e4769b0a81257408c03e\",\"byteLength\":245283,\"url\":\"https://persistent.oaistatic.com/space-presentation-templates/weekly-business-review/28b9e7ae1f36383f5b9079f13744a190972ddb1c6266663789584d53c37dc750/presentation.pb\",\"format\":\"presentation-protobuf\"},\"id\":\"weekly-business-review\"},{\"source\":{\"sha256\":\"b4b228b4ed45654348513b40a2a41a16612fedc1ce0d0317379a34e22813149c\",\"url\":\"https://persistent.oaistatic.com/space-presentation-templates/photography-portfolio/5d8abc9c361cd00c938b1b18aaf8ec2f731afea409eb23a17b823cdca6d1111e/presentation.pb\",\"byteLength\":2841567,\"for